# mod-custom-spells: the Shaman lines of the third concept list
# (operator 2026-10-31; share-public
# custom-spells/records/2026-10-31-third-concept-list.md), wave 1 = the
# spell modifiers. Every check states the list's line, so a FAIL marks a
# defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one. The
# bot stands west of the ring facing it.
# Wave 2 (procs, 2026-10-31): Enhancement 900445 "movementspeed ... additional
# 100% for 3 seconds when entering ghost wolf in combat. also your next hit that
# makes you exit ghost form, erupts in lightning" and Restoration 900468 (heals
# launch Lightning Bolt / Chain Lightning / Flame Shock), 900469 (Earth Shield
# spikes), 900470 (direct heals add an Earth Shield charge). Ghost Wolf 2645 is
# put on by the director (`.aura 2645`): the spell is outdoors-only, the aura is
# the same; Healing Wave 49273, Lesser Healing Wave 49276, Chain Heal 55459,
# Riptide 61301 (talent), Lightning Bolt 49238, Chain Lightning 49271, Flame
# Shock 49233, Earth Shield 49284 (rank 5, 6 charges, talent), Combat Tester
# 11080 (level 60, hostile, 305,200 health, melee only, fights only when
# attacked) 75 yd north of the ring for the fights that hit the shaman.
# Spells: Stormstrike 17364 (talent; debuff cast, its weapon strikes 32175 /
# 32176), Lava Lash 60103 (talent, needs an off-hand weapon). Modifier checks
# only: the chains work as Obliterate's and Mutilate's hand strikes do.
# Wave 3 (large items, 2026-10-31): 900401 / 900433 / 900466 "Totems replaced by
# creatures that follow/fight" (each totem keeps its effect and gets a spirit
# creature: Flame 900419 / Stone 900420 / Tide 900421 / Wind 900422, the
# totem hidden while its spirit lives), 900472 "You can now use earth shield on
# unlimited targets", 900473 "if you direct heal your healing stream totem, your
# heal also applies with 75% to near allies. also increases healing stream
# totems healing by 25% for 30 seconds. stacks 10 times." Totems: Strength of
# Earth 58643 (earth slot, totem 31129), Searing Totem 58704 (fire slot, attack
# 58702), Fire Elemental Totem 2894 (gets no spirit), Wrath of Air Totem 3738 (air
# slot), Healing Stream Totem rank 9 58757 (water slot; the aura family mask
# 0x2000 spells 5672 .. 58765), Totemic Recall 36936. `al` (a warrior bot) and
# the director are the other two members of the group; the splash and the Earth
# Shield checks need them.
name    Custom spells - Shaman third list
timeout 480s

bot sh shaman slot=4
bot al warrior

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require sh alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near sh
require d1 exists
do gm target sh
as gm .unlearn 900441
as gm .unlearn 900442
as gm .unlearn 900443
as gm .unlearn 900444
as gm .unlearn 900445
as gm .unlearn 900468
as gm .unlearn 900469
as gm .unlearn 900470
as gm .unlearn 900472
as gm .unlearn 900473
as gm .unlearn 900401
as gm .unlearn 900433
as gm .unlearn 900466
as gm .unlearn 900402
as gm .unlearn 900435
do sh learn 17364
do sh learn 60103

log Control - without the passives nothing is modified
expect sh spellmod 32175 damage 100 == 100
expect sh spellmod 60103 jumptargets 0 == 0

log Enhancement - 900441 "Storm Strike damage" (+50 %), 900442 "Storm Strike targets" (+9 = 10) on both weapon strikes; the debuff cast stays single-target
do sh learn 900441
do sh learn 900442
expect sh spellmod 32175 damage 100 == 150
expect sh spellmod 32176 damage 100 == 150
expect sh spellmod 32175 jumptargets 0 == 10
expect sh spellmod 32176 jumptargets 0 == 10
expect sh spellmod 17364 jumptargets 0 == 0

log Enhancement - 900443 "Lava Lash damage" (+50 %), 900444 "Lava Lash targets" (+9 = 10)
do sh learn 900443
do sh learn 900444
expect sh spellmod 60103 damage 100 == 150
expect sh spellmod 60103 jumptargets 0 == 10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- wave 2: Enhancement
log Enhancement - 900445 control: without the passive Ghost Wolf in combat gives no Storm Rush and no charge
do sh learn 2645
do sh learn 49238
do sh reset
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 400ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 600ms
expect sh incombat
as gm .aura 2645
waitfor sh aura 2645 timeout 3s
wait 300ms
expect sh noaura 900446
expect sh noaura 900447
as gm .unaura 2645
waitfor sh noaura 2645 timeout 3s

log Enhancement - 900445 "movementspeed is increased by additional 100% for 3 seconds when entering ghost wolf in combat": in combat the form brings Storm Rush (900446, 3 s) and the hidden Storm Charge (900447)
do sh learn 900445
do sh reset
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 400ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 600ms
expect sh incombat
as gm .aura 2645
waitfor sh aura 2645 timeout 3s
waitfor sh aura 900446 timeout 2s
expect sh auramaxduration 900446 == 3000
expect sh aura 900447

log Enhancement - 900445 "also your next hit that makes you exit ghost form, erupts in lightning dealing aoe damage": leaving the form puts the charge on a 4-s window (not before), the next hit erupts (900448, Nature, 10 yd round the hit dummy) and takes the charge
expect sh auramaxduration 900447 == -1
as gm .unaura 2645
waitfor sh noaura 2645 timeout 3s
wait 300ms
expect sh aura 900447
expect sh auramaxduration 900447 == 4000
spelllog start
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 2s
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900448 casts == 1
expect sh spell 900448 maxtargets >= 6
expect sh noaura 900447

log Enhancement - 900445 the eruption is for the hit of the window only: a second hit does nothing
spelllog start
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900448 casts == 0

log Enhancement - 900445 the window is 4 s: a hit after it erupts nothing (the charge has run out)
do sh reset
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 400ms
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 600ms
as gm .aura 2645
waitfor sh aura 2645 timeout 3s
expect sh aura 900447
as gm .unaura 2645
waitfor sh noaura 2645 timeout 3s
wait 4500ms
expect sh noaura 900447
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 800ms
spelllog start
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900448 casts == 0

log Enhancement - 900445 Ghost Wolf out of combat arms nothing
do sh reset
as gm .aura 2645
waitfor sh aura 2645 timeout 3s
wait 300ms
expect sh outofcombat
expect sh noaura 900446
expect sh noaura 900447
as gm .unaura 2645
waitfor sh noaura 2645 timeout 3s
as gm .unlearn 900445

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- wave 2: Restoration
log Restoration - control: without 900468 a Healing Wave casts no Lightning Bolt (the dummies kept in combat by a triggered Lightning Bolt)
do sh learn 49273
do sh learn 49276
do sh learn 55459
do sh learn 61301
do sh learn 49271
do sh learn 49233
do sh learn 49284
do sh reset
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog start
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 49273 casts >= 1
expect sh spell 49238 casts == 0

log Restoration - 900468 "Casting Lesser Healing Wave/Healing waves launches a free Lightning Bolt at a random target in range": a Healing Wave and a Lesser Healing Wave each launch one Lightning Bolt (49238) at an enemy in combat
do sh learn 900468
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog start
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 49238 casts == 1
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog start
do sh cast 49276 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 49238 casts == 1

log Restoration - 900468 "Casting Chain Heal launches a free Chain Lightning at a random target in range": a Chain Heal launches one Chain Lightning (49271)
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog start
do sh cast 55459 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 55459 casts >= 1
expect sh spell 49271 casts == 1

log Restoration - 900468 an idle enemy is never pulled: with every dummy out of combat (five seconds without a hit) a Healing Wave launches nothing
do sh reset
wait 6s
spelllog start
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 49273 casts >= 1
expect sh spell 49238 casts == 0
log Restoration - 900468 "Riptide applies Flame Shock at a random target in range": a Riptide applies one Flame Shock (49233) to an enemy in combat
do sh cast 49238 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog start
do sh cast 61301 on sh triggered
wait 1200ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 61301 casts >= 1
expect sh spell 49233 casts == 1

as gm .unlearn 900468

log Restoration - 900469 / 900470 the Combat Tester (11080) 75 yd north of the ring hits a shaman who carries an Earth Shield; phase A is the control (neither passive): the shield heals, no spike, and a Healing Wave on the shield's holder leaves its charges as they are
do sh goto -270 228 -422.72
do gm goto -270 230 -422.72
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 11080
do gm goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
pick ct creature:11080 near sh
require ct exists
do sh approach ct 3
do sh reset
do sh cast 49284 on sh triggered
waitfor sh aura 49284 timeout 3s
expect sh auracharges 49284 == 6
spelllog start
do sh cast 49238 on ct triggered
waitfor ct victim sh timeout 5s
waitfor sh auracharges 49284 <= 5 timeout 12s
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh auracharges 49284 == 5
wait 4s
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 379 heal > 0
expect sh spell 900471 casts == 0

log Restoration - 900470 "Your direct heal spells increase the stacks of your shields on the target by 1" (capped at the shield's own maximum): the shield recast to 6 charges, the first proc takes one (5), a Healing Wave brings it back to 6; a Healing Wave at 6 stays at 6
do sh learn 900470
do sh cast 49284 on sh triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh auracharges 49284 == 6
do sh learn 900469
spelllog start
waitfor sh auracharges 49284 <= 5 timeout 12s
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh auracharges 49284 == 6
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh auracharges 49284 == 6

log Restoration - 900469 "earth shield get spikes, damaging the attacker (nature dmg, scaling with paragon lvl)": the shield's proc that heals also strikes the Combat Tester with 900471 (Nature, 666 + 5 x Paragon level)
wait 4s
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900471 hits >= 1
expect sh spell 900471 damage >= 500
do gm target ct
as gm .die
do gm target sh
as gm .unaura 49284
as gm .unlearn 900469
as gm .unlearn 900470

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- wave 3: Shaman large items
log Wave 3 setup - back on the ring, the totems of the earlier checks recalled
do sh goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do sh reset
do sh cast 36936 triggered
wait 1s
require al alive

log Elemental - 900401 "Totems replaced by creatures that follow/fight" (control): without a totem passive a Strength of Earth Totem stands alone - no spirit
do sh cast 58643 triggered
wait 2s
pick tot creature:31129 near sh
require tot exists
expect sh minions 900420 == 0

log Elemental - 900401 with the passive the totem is joined within a second by a Stone Spirit (900420, the earth slot); exactly one, and a totem that replaces it brings no second one
do sh learn 900401
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 1 timeout 4s
pick sp creature:900420 near sh
require sp exists
expect sp alive
expect sp noaura 901109
do sh cast 58643 triggered
wait 2s
expect sh minions 900420 == 1

log Elemental - 900401 the spirit follows the shaman (20 yd away, 3.5 s) and so does the totem it stands for
pick tot creature:31129 near sh
pick sp creature:900420 near sh
do sh goto -299 150 -423.2
wait 3500ms
expect sp near -299 150 -423.2 8
expect tot near -299 150 -423.2 8

log Elemental - 900401 the spirit fights the shaman's target: the shaman melees the dummy and the spirit takes it up
do sh goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 2s
do sh approach d1
do sh attack d1
waitfor sp victim d1 timeout 8s
do sh stop

log Elemental - 900401 the totem keeps its effect while hidden: a Searing Totem (fire slot, Flame Spirit 900419) still shoots the dummy the shaman attacks
do sh cast 58704 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900419 == 1 timeout 4s
do sh attack d1
spelllog start
waitfor sh spell 58702 hits >= 2 timeout 25s
spelllog stop
do sh stop
expect sh spell 58702 hits >= 2
expect sh minions 900420 == 1

log Enhancement - 900435 a totem spirit is a summon of the shaman: with Empowered Summons it carries the +50 % damage aura (901109)
do sh learn 900435
wait 1500ms
pick sp creature:900420 near sh
expect sp aura 901109
as gm .unlearn 900435

log Elemental - 900402 compatibility: the Fire Elemental Totem gets no spirit (its elemental is the creature), the elemental still becomes Ragnaros with twice the health, and the Flame Spirit of the Searing Totem it replaced is gone
do sh learn 900402
do sh cast 2894 triggered
wait 2500ms
pick fe creature:15438 near sh
require fe exists
expect fe maxhealth >= 16000
expect sh minions 900419 == 0
as gm .unlearn 900402

log Elemental - 900401 the spirit lives with its totem: Totemic Recall takes both
do sh cast 36936 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 0 timeout 4s
expect sh minions 900420 == 0
expect sh minions 900419 == 0

log Elemental - 900401 killing the spirit does not take the totem: the totem stays, a new spirit comes after 15 s
do sh cast 58643 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 1 timeout 4s
pick tot creature:31129 near sh
pick sp creature:900420 near sh
require sp exists
do gm target sp
as gm .die
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 0 timeout 4s
expect tot alive
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 1 timeout 25s

log Elemental - 900401 unlearning the passive takes the spirit away and leaves the totem
as gm .unlearn 900401
waitfor sh minions 900420 == 0 timeout 4s
expect tot alive
do sh cast 36936 triggered
wait 1s

log Enhancement - 900433 and Restoration - 900466 raise the same spirits (the Wind Spirit 900422 of an air totem: Wrath of Air Totem 3738)
do sh learn 900433
do sh cast 3738 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900422 == 1 timeout 4s
as gm .unlearn 900433
waitfor sh minions 900422 == 0 timeout 4s
do sh learn 900466
do sh cast 3738 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900422 == 1 timeout 4s
do sh cast 36936 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900422 == 0 timeout 4s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Earth Shield unlimited
log Restoration - 900472 control: Earth Shield on the director, the warrior bot and the shaman in turn stays on the last one only (the single-target rule)
as gm .unlearn 900472
do sh cast 49284 on gm triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49284 on al triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49284 on sh triggered
wait 500ms
expect gm noaura 49284
expect al noaura 49284
expect sh aura 49284

log Restoration - 900472 "You can now use earth shield on unlimited targets": with the passive the same three casts leave the shield on all three
do sh learn 900472
do sh cast 49284 on gm triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49284 on al triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49284 on sh triggered
wait 500ms
expect gm aura 49284
expect al aura 49284
expect sh aura 49284

log Restoration - 900472 each kept shield is a working shield (6 charges) and a fourth cast on the first target only refreshes it - the other two stay
expect gm auracharges 49284 == 6
do sh cast 49284 on gm triggered
wait 500ms
expect gm aura 49284
expect al aura 49284
expect sh aura 49284
as gm .unlearn 900472

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Healing Stream surge
log Restoration - 900473 setup: Healing Stream Totem (water slot) and its Tide Spirit (900421) under 900466
do sh learn 900466
do sh cast 58757 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900421 == 1 timeout 4s
pick hb creature:900421 near sh
require hb exists
expect sh spellmod 58765 damage 100 == 100

log Restoration - 900473 control: without the passive a Healing Wave on the spirit splashes nothing and gives no stack
do gm target sh
as gm .damage 6000
spelllog start
do sh cast 49273 on hb triggered
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900474 hits == 0
expect sh noaura 900475

log Restoration - 900473 "if you direct heal your healing stream totem, your heal also applies with 75% to near allies": a Healing Wave on the spirit heals the damaged shaman (and the group within 10 yd) through the splash 900474
do sh learn 900473
do gm target sh
as gm .damage 6000
spelllog start
do sh cast 49273 on hb triggered
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect sh spell 900474 hits >= 1
expect sh spell 900474 heal > 0

log Restoration - 900473 "also increases healing stream totems healing by 25% for 30 seconds. stacks 10 times": one stack (+25 % on the Healing Stream auras, 30 s), then three
expect sh aurastacks 900475 == 1
expect sh auramaxduration 900475 == 30000
expect sh spellmod 58765 damage 100 == 125
do sh cast 49273 on hb triggered
wait 300ms
do sh cast 49273 on hb triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh aurastacks 900475 == 3
expect sh spellmod 58765 damage 100 == 175
expect sh spellmod 5672 damage 100 == 175

log Restoration - 900473 only the Healing Stream spirit counts: a Healing Wave on the shaman himself adds no stack
do sh cast 49273 on sh triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh aurastacks 900475 == 3

log Restoration - 900473 the stacks ride on a Chain Heal on the spirit as well (a direct heal)
do sh cast 55459 on hb triggered
wait 300ms
expect sh aurastacks 900475 == 4
do sh cast 36936 triggered
waitfor sh minions 900421 == 0 timeout 4s
as gm .unlearn 900473
as gm .unlearn 900466
as gm .unaura 49284

cleanup
do sh stop
do gm target sh
as gm .unlearn 900441
as gm .unlearn 900442
as gm .unlearn 900443
as gm .unlearn 900444
as gm .unlearn 900445
as gm .unlearn 900468
as gm .unlearn 900469
as gm .unlearn 900470
as gm .unlearn 900472
as gm .unlearn 900473
as gm .unlearn 900401
as gm .unlearn 900433
as gm .unlearn 900466
as gm .unlearn 900402
as gm .unlearn 900435
do sh cast 36936 triggered
